{
  "comment": "Pinned CC0 upstream libraries (owner decision 28 Oct 2026, D-193). Audio and LICENSE are taken from audio_commit; SFZ mappings from mapping_commit. A referenced sample must have the same git blob id at both commits or the build fails. Paths matching any 'exclude' pattern are fatal unless listed in 'allow' with a reason. VCSL: the Yamaha upright is not used because its samples on the sfz branch (a commit without a LICENSE file) differ from master (D-195).",
